</section>

<!-- ── ABOUT ── -->
<section id="about">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="row align-items-center gy-5 mb-5">
      <div class="col-lg-6 reveal">
        <div class="sec-label c-blue">Who We Are</div>
        <h2 class="sec-title">More Than<br><span class="c-orange">A Club</span></h2>
        <p class="sec-desc mt-3">
          AKASA Sport Club was founded in 2018 with a single mission — to create an inclusive, high-performance environment where every athlete can thrive. From beginners to elite competitors, we welcome everyone who shares a love for sport.
        </p>
        <div class="about-highlight mt-4">
          "Sport is the great equalizer. At AKASA, we don't just train bodies — we build character, resilience, and brotherhood."
          <div style="font-size:0.72rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1px;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--blue);margin-top:0.8rem;">— Founder, AKASA Sport Club</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-lg-5 offset-lg-1 reveal">
        <div class="row g-3">
          <div class="col-6">
            <div class="fact-box" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--blue),#5b9dff)">
              <div class="fact-num">320+</div>
              <div class="fact-lbl">Active Members</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="col-6">
            <div class="fact-box" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--orange),#ffab5e)">
              <div class="fact-num">8</div>
              <div class="fact-lbl">Sport Divisions</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="col-6">
            <div class="fact-box" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--green),#52e08a)">
              <div class="fact-num">47</div>
              <div class="fact-lbl">Trophies Won</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="col-6">
            <div class="fact-box" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--purple),#b48aff)">
              <div class="fact-num">12+</div>
              <div class="fact-lbl">Expert Coaches</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Vision & Mission -->
    <div class="row g-4">
      <div class="col-lg-6 reveal">
        <div style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--blue), #5b9dff); border-radius: 16px; padding: 2.5rem; height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center;">
          <div style="font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.9); margin-bottom: 1rem;">Our Vision</div>
          <h3 style="font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 2.2rem; letter-spacing: 1px; color: #fff; margin-bottom: 1rem; line-height: 1.2;">To Be The Premier Sports Community</h3>
          <p style="color: rgba(255,255,255,0.95); font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.6; font-weight: 400;">
            A thriving hub where athletes of all levels come together to pursue excellence, build meaningful relationships, and inspire each other to achieve their personal best in sport and in life.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-lg-6 reveal">
        <div style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--orange), #ffab5e); border-radius: 16px; padding: 2.5rem; height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center;">
          <div style="font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.9); margin-bottom: 1rem;">Our Mission</div>
          <h3 style="font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 2.2rem; letter-spacing: 1px; color: #fff; margin-bottom: 1rem; line-height: 1.2;">Empower Through Sport</h3>
          <p style="color: rgba(255,255,255,0.95); font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.6; font-weight: 400;">
            To provide accessible, high-quality sports programs and training that develop athletic skills, foster teamwork, build character, and create a supportive community where every member can grow and excel.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

